### Booking service health
GET http://localhost:5102/health

### Create booking
POST http://localhost:5102/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "6a031f55291fb0c724fa220b",
  "startingLocation": "Valletta",
  "endingLocation": "Sliema",
  "bookingDateTime": "2026-06-01T18:30:00.000Z",
  "passengers": 2,
  "cabType": "Economic"
}

### Get current bookings
GET http://localhost:5102/bookings/current/6a031f55291fb0c724fa220b

### Get past bookings
GET http://localhost:5102/bookings/past/6a031f55291fb0c724fa220b

### Get booking by ID
GET http://localhost:5102/bookings/6a032b30963be502c4f938b2

### Mark booking as completed
PATCH http://localhost:5102/bookings/6a032b30963be502c4f938b2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### Cancel booking
PATCH http://localhost:5102/bookings/6a032b30963be502c4f938b2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "cancelled"
}
